# Wholly original synthetic land TED fixture for the P1-06 map mode.
# No installed map bytes are present. It declares a 33x25 heightfield
# shaped as a shallow dome, 2 material slots (the second one declares a
# secondary diffuse texture so the dual-diffuse TERRAIN selection is
# exercised), a passability plane, and one environment record naming a
# skydome object that deliberately resolves against no catalog.
